          "dimension": "feasible route and trick counting",
          "fact": "The initial club route is executable and supplies the stated conditional trick totals.",
          "explanation": "Authorized holdings are South CAK864 and North CQ72, with five outside winners in DAK, HA, HK and SA. CA with C2, a low club to CQ, and C7 to CK leave two South clubs: both win against 3–2, while conceding one establishes the other against 4–1. Outside controls provide recovery entries. D3 is a legal follow to DQ.",
